### Forge (src/Forge/forge.bs): the private fns here are fed by UNPROVEN values (list elements, nested fields)
variant  beam stripped Code instrs Code-md5
cur      2128 641 328 41 Oh7KYD
narrow   2100 632 316 39 XtLZrW
widen    2168 648 333 42 fSIcdp
(Code-md5 equal for cur and widen on Many = the optimiser removed every private is_integer there;
 on Forge it cannot, so widen costs real bytes exactly where the extra test is doing work.)
